From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Frank Liberato <liberato@google.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:12:28 -0700
Subject: media: Add regression test for mov_read_trun buffer overflow

Adds FFmpegDemuxerTest.TrunBufferOverflow_Crbug573128234 to verify that
demuxing a fragmented MP4 whose trun sample count exceeds index entries
does not trigger an out-of-bounds heap write in FFmpeg's mov_read_trun.

Verification:
- Repro (Before): Chrome Reprobot Linux -> heap-buffer-overflow WRITE 1188 at mov_read_trun (mov.c:6398)
- Fix (After): out/Linux/media_unittests --gtest_filter="FFmpegDemuxerTest.TrunBufferOverflow_Crbug573128234" -> PASSED (6 ms)
- Regression: out/Linux/media_unittests --gtest_filter="FFmpegDemuxerTest.*" -> 48 passed, 0 failures

